{
  "$comment": "EXP-1279 (EXP-1259 D13): the code-mode card x4. crates/codemode records every tool call a script makes as `{tool: '<server>.<tool>', subject, ok, ms}` (subject = the call's contract `subjectKey` argument for an Exponential tool, else the first string argument, trimmed to 80 chars), capped at `logCap` entries, and returns the log in the CallToolResult `_meta` under `metaKey` with the total under `metaCountKey` and the script's wall time under `metaElapsedKey` (never in the text content: the model never pays for it). The engine maps a tool call whose name ends in `codemode__exec` to contract toolKind `script` and, when its result arrives, attaches the log to the settled tool item as `script: {count, elapsedMs, calls}` (relay wire + every client's feed). Model = pure `scriptCard(input)` (TS reference packages/domain-contract/src/script-card.ts; mirrors desktop steer::script_card, iOS ExpCore ScriptCard.swift, Android domain/ScriptCard.kt), every mirror replays `cases`. Paint: the tool card shell; header = the `{ }` glyph (concept `tool-script`), `title` (medium) and the muted `meta`, trailing a `Script` disclosure (copy.script) that reveals the script source (the exec input's `script`) in a mono block; then one row per group: the brand mark (Exponential tools) or the coding-tool glyph, the label, the muted subject + `more`, trailing `count` (muted) or `failed` (rose); `overflow` = a final muted row. Groups keep first-call order. While running: the title alone with the run's spinner. Review #15: under a minute the duration is tenths = round-half-up(ms / 100) as an INTEGER, printed `{tenths / 10}.{tenths % 10} s` (1250 ms = `1.3 s`, 1249 ms = `1.2 s`), never a float formatter.",
  "logCap": 200,
  "metaKey": "exponential/calls",
  "metaCountKey": "exponential/callCount",
  "metaElapsedKey": "exponential/elapsedMs",
  "toolNameSuffix": "codemode__exec",
  "copy": {
    "running": "Running a script",
    "done": "Ran a script",
    "script": "Script",
    "call": "call",
    "calls": "calls",
    "failed": "failed",
    "moreCall": "more call",
    "moreCalls": "more calls"
  },
  "testIds": {
    "card": "script-card",
    "group": "script-card-group",
    "source": "script-card-source"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a running script is the title alone",
      "input": {
        "running": true,
        "count": 0,
        "calls": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "title": "Running a script",
        "meta": null,
        "groups": [],
        "overflow": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "calls group by tool in first-call order with subjects, counts and failures",
      "input": {
        "running": false,
        "count": 8,
        "elapsedMs": 3040,
        "calls": [
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_get",
            "subject": "EXP-1253",
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 40
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_get",
            "subject": "EXP-1254",
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 41
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_update",
            "subject": "EXT-1",
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 60
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_get",
            "subject": "EXP-1255",
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 39
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_relations_add",
            "subject": "EXT-15",
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 70
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_relations_add",
            "subject": "MKT-1",
            "ok": false,
            "ms": 12
          },
          {
            "tool": "computer.screenshot",
            "subject": null,
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 300
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_comments_create",
            "subject": "MKT-6",
            "ok": true,
            "ms": 90
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "title": "Ran a script",
        "meta": "8 calls · 3.0 s",
        "groups": [
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_get",
            "exponential": true,
            "label": "Read issue",
            "subject": "EXP-1253",
            "more": "+2",
            "count": "×3",
            "failed": null
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_update",
            "exponential": true,
            "label": "Updated issue",
            "subject": "EXT-1",
            "more": null,
            "count": null,
            "failed": null
          },
          {
            "tool": "exponential.exponential_issues_relations_add",
            "exponential": true,
            "label": "Linked issues",
            "subject": "EXT-15",
            "more": "+1",
            "count": null,
            "failed": "1 failed"
          },
          {
            "tool": "computer.screenshot",
            "exponential": false,
            "label": "computer.screenshot",
            "subject": null,
            "more": null,
            "count": null,
            "failed": null
